body:
Another NPE happens for a query type "polygon":

``` json
{
  "query": {
    "geo_shape": {
      "location": {
        "shape": {
          "type": "polygon",
          "coordinates": ["4.901238","52.36936"]
        }
      }
    }
  }
}
```

